{"hymn":"S729","parent":"E885","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Lucha siempre en el Cuerpo","subtitle":"La guerra espiritual—En el cuerpo","syl":{"n1":["Lu","i"],"n2":["cha","t"],"n3":["siem","i"],"n4":["pre","t"],"n5":"en","n6":"el","n7":["Cuer","i"],"n8":["po,","t"],"n9":"Por","n10":"tu","n11":["cuen","i"],"n12":["ta","t"],"n13":"no","n14":["po","i"],"n15":["drás;","t"],"n16":["Só","i"],"n17":["lo‿u","m"],"n18":["ni","m"],"n19":["do‿a","t"],"n20":"la","n21":["Ca","i"],"n22":["be","m"],"n23":["za,","t"],"n24":["Des","i"],"n25":["de‿el","t"],"n26":["tro","i"],"n27":["no","t"],"n28":["ven","i"],"n29":["ce","m"],"n30":["rás.","t"],"n31":["Lu","i"],"n32":["cha","t"],"n33":["siem","i"],"n34":["pre","t"],"n35":"en","n36":"el","n37":["Cuer","i"],"n38":["po,","t"],"n39":"La","n40":["Ca","i"],"n41":["be","m"],"n42":["za","t"],"n43":"da‿el","n44":["po","i"],"n45":["der;","t"],"n46":["Só","i"],"n47":["lo","t"],"n48":["fir","i"],"n49":["me","t"],"n50":"en","n51":"el","n52":["Cuer","i"],"n53":["po,","t"],"n54":"La","n55":["vic","i"],"n56":["to","m"],"n57":["ria","t"],"n58":["po","i"],"n59":["drás","t"],"n60":"ver."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["La armadura es para el Cuerpo,","No es con fin individual;","Cuando luchas en el Cuerpo","El provecho es total."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["A la iglesia firme en Cristo","Satanás no vencerá;","Es el Cuerpo edificado","Quien al mal resistirá."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Con el Cuerpo y la Cabeza,","Desde el trono celestial,","Lucha en contra del maligno,","Y los príncipes del mal."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Con los miembros en el Cuerpo,","Para Dios firme has de estar;","En tu espíritu orando,","Por la sangre triunfarás."]},{"label":"6.","lines":["En lugares celestiales","Con Su fuerza y Su vigor,","Como todo un reclutado,","Lucha y vence en el Señor."]},{"label":"7.","lines":["Sigue luchando en el Cuerpo,","La victoria obtendrás;","Desatando y atando,","El rival será tu pan."]}]}